option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH=Sun and moon intensity
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH=Ambient light intensity
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH=Vanilla block light intensity
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts vanilla lightmap illumination. Colored voxel light retains its calibrated emitter intensity.
option.NETHER_AMBIENT=Nether ambient intensity
option.END_AMBIENT=End ambient intensity
option.WATER_BIOME_TINT=Biome water tint
option.WATER_BIOME_TINT.comment=Mixes the flat biome color into water scattering. Native water texture and texture alpha are not used.
option.WATER_DENSITY=Water absorption
option.WATER_DENSITY.comment=Higher values absorb light more quickly with depth. Shallow water remains clear.
option.WATER_TURBIDITY=Water turbidity
option.WATER_TURBIDITY.comment=Adds neutral extinction per block. Zero retains only wavelength-dependent absorption.
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave strength
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED=Wave speed
option.WATER_WAVE_DETAIL=Wave layers
option.WATER_WAVE_DETAIL.comment=Two, four or eight wave scales. Fewer layers reduce fragment shader cost.
option.WATER_ROUGHNESS=Surface roughness
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Refraction strength
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS=Reflection ray steps
option.WATER_REFLECTION_STEPS.comment=Zero uses sky reflections. Screen-space tracing requires screen-space water and deferred lighting.
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Leaf movement
option.WAVING_GRASS=Grass and flower movement
option.WIND_STRENGTH=Wind strength
option.WIND_SPEED=Wind speed
option.WIND_DISTANCE=Wind draw distance
option.WIND_DISTANCE.comment=Smoothly fades animation with camera distance. Grass stems stay anchored and shadows use the same displacement.
option.MOTION_BLUR=Camera motion blur
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Depth-aware blur from camera translation and rotation. Independent moving objects have no motion vectors. Off by default.
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH=Shutter fraction
option.MOTION_BLUR_STRENGTH.comment=Fraction of the frame interval used for exposure. 0.5 corresponds to a 180-degree shutter.
option.MOTION_BLUR_SAMPLES=Motion blur samples
option.BLOOM=HDR bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Quarter-resolution highlights with filtered upsampling. Allocates a separate buffer only when enabled.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom intensity
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Bloom threshold
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Saturation
option.COLOR_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.WHITE_BALANCE=White balance
option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Negative values cool the scene; positive values warm it.
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING=Adaptive sharpening
option.IMAGE_SHARPENING.comment=Clamps sharpening to nearby colors to limit halos. Zero removes the additional texture samples.
option.SHADOW_FILTER_TAPS=Shadow filter samples
option.AO_SLICES=AO direction slices
option.AO_STRENGTH=Ambient occlusion strength
